  "defect_and_change": {
    "most_important": "SKILL.md is unreadable in the campaign configuration (a Read outside the working directory is refused: D27 has no Read allowance and --add-dir is not in the allowed flags), and the helper had no usage text. In d-s2 the model, told to Read SKILL.md, was refused, then spent seven invalid helper calls (and tried `--help` first) learning the `decide` batch format; it modelled the task order as which task goes FIRST among five single-step options, so Jev's top option scored 0.93-0.94, never above 0.95, and it ended without doing the task (the R02 dev S2, ledger 5, passed the oracle). It also never passed --decision-id, so its three `expand` results were three new decisions. In d-s3r the model also tried `search --help`, and piped `search` into `head`, which voids the grant.",
    "fixed": [
